    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253300/extras/6422c36a1362ccc03af3f75acfc32a72.poster.avif?t=1732659042\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253300/extras/6422c36a1362ccc03af3f75acfc32a72.webm?t=1732659042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game of Hangman with a\u00a0dark twist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Or is it?)\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >F\u0334\u0344\u031f\u0327\u0325\u031e\u033b\u0316\u0359\u035a\u0353I\u0336\u030f\u030f\u031a\u0312\u030f\u0311\u030e\u030d\u030c\u030f\u0307\u033a\u0328\u0328\u032e\u0327\u0349N\u0334\u0305\u0300\u0342\u030f\u0311\u0300\u0302\u033d\u035d\u0309\u0341\u034b\u033a\u0347\u0321\u0317\u0348\u0359\u0323\u0332D\u0338\u0357\u0351\u0340\u030c\u0315\u033c\u0354\u0349\u0347\u032d\u0347\u035c\u0325 \u0334\u0315\u0307\u034c\u0351\u034e\u0325\u031e\u032aM\u0334\u031a\u0357\u0310\u0302\u0304\u030e\u0310\u0341\u0350\u033e\u034a\u033d\u034a\u0300\u031b\u034d\u0316\u0332\u0359\u0347\u0322\u0324\u032b\u0316E\u0337\u0311\u0340\u0310\u034d\u0332\u0331\u0325</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally posted on Itch and made for the GAM135 course at USV in under three weeks. <strong>Now on Steam with a new, major update - will you find it?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential to be updated with even more content in the future but for now, enjoy this short experience of the game we all know.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Includes Random Word Mode)\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to check out our links, discord, and upcoming games!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >xxx\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Poxet\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253300/extras/8db96ac3fa6cbe1cda2ae12c8b287592.avif?t=1732659042\" width=726 height=350 /></span></p>",
